.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt SET_AT_SA 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm set_at_sa
.Nd retrieve a set element into a stralloc
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In set.h
.Ft char *
.Fn set_at_sa "const set_t *set" "int64 pos" "stralloc *out"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn set_at_sa
function retrieves the set element at index position
.Fa pos
and stores it as a null-terminated string in the dynamic string allocation structure
.Fa out .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns a pointer to the string buffer, or
.Dv NULL
if the index is out of bounds.